{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/496067-the-court-of-pain","id":496067,"title":"The Court of Pain","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Changeling: The Lost"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-04-29T01:31:34-07:00","id":496067,"title":"The Court of Pain","content":"In armory reloaded it floats the idea of changelings feeding off of pain.<br /> <br /> So if you're willing to have changelings going all cenobite in your game, what would the court of pain be like in your game?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/391-stsword","name":"StSword","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar391_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1635"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-29T05:36:02-07:00","id":496196,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"font-size:14px\">There is strength in pain, for those who know how to recognize it. Those who know the proper way to feed upon their suffering can block out distracting emotions such as fear, lust or greed. Excruciating pain can give you focus like a razor's edge when it comes to fulfilling your goals. The more pain you accept into yourself, the more pain you learn to inflict upon your enemies. Unfortunately not everybody knows how to feed on pain in the same manner as the courtiers, and few have the strength to endure it once they learn how.<br /> <br /> <br /> The Court of Pain has found strength in suffering either that of themselves or others. Their scholars and philosophers tend to be masochistic, learning from pain through personal experience. Their warriors, on the other hand, are sadistic in nature, inflicting the results of their research upon those who threaten the court and its members. Every member of the Court of Pain bares multiple scars in some fashion, whether these be physical, emotional, or mental.<br /> <br /> <br /> The Court of Pain has its hands in a variety of avenues for the study of pain. Some work as acupuncturists, learning to map out the nervous system and discover where it is most sensitive, as well as how to treat it. Others work in S&amp;M clubs, providing aid for those who are addicted to suffering, though their treatments are a tad more realistic than their clients were expecting. Those who get a job as interrogators utilize methods that belong in the dark ages to extract information from their prisoners. Others work as psychologists, seeking to understand how their client's past experiences damaged them in such a fashion, and if there is a way to replicate such trauma upon the True Fae.<br /> <br /> <br /> Pain is not weakness, rather it tells you what your weaknesses are. The courtiers know that pain tells you where you are injured and how close to death you have become. The right surge of pain can send even a weakling into a killing frenzy when surrounded by their enemies. The Court of Pain will never lie, their philosophy does carry great personal risk, but those willing to accept the consequences of their actions will find a power that few are able to tap into.</span><br /> <br /> <br /> --------------------------------------<br /> <br /> How's that? <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> Made it up on the spot!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1394,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","user":"Nyrufa","date":". 04-29-2015, 09:20 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-30T03:40:58-07:00","id":497289,"title":"","content":"Very nice, thank you. <br /> <br /> Maybe when the court system gets shown or lost second edition comes out some court contracts can be worked out to flesh these guys out.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/391-stsword","name":"StSword","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar391_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1635"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}